This directory contains the BWR Progression Problems developed by Chase Lawing et al.
They are adapted from https://github.com/cdlawing1/BWRProgressionProblemInputs, having
been updated for more recent versions of VERA.  Reference solutions generated with
Serpent-2 and MCNP are also available in the GitHub repository.

The complete documentation of these problems can be found in https://www.osti.gov/servlets/purl/1838995.

When referencing these problems, please cite the above report:
Lawing, Chase, Scott Palmtag, and Mehdi Asgari.
BWR Progression Problems. No. ORNL/TM-2020/1792.
Oak Ridge National Lab.(ORNL), Oak Ridge, TN (United States), 2021.

